<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.0100 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.0100 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.0100 per</p>
<p>dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after</p>
<p>74.6700 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 23		  Apr 22</p>
<p> High			     75.0100		 74.9000</p>
<p> Low				74.4500		 74.2500</p>
<p> Open			     74.9000		 74.9000</p>
<p> Close			    75.0100		 74.6700</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     6.210		   3.795</p>
